*** Settings ***
Documentation       Technical helper keywords for the interface. Only here are keywords {{ 'of the RequestsLibrary' if api_library == 'requests' else 'of RESTinstance' }} used.
...                 Every request returns a dictionary with "status" (status code) and "body" (content).
Resource            ${EXECDIR}/resources/abilities/api_ability.resource
Keyword Tags        interaction


*** Keywords ***
Send Get Request
    [Documentation]    Queries an endpoint. Further arguments are added as query parameters.
    [Arguments]    ${path}    &{parameters}
{%- if api_library == 'requests' %}
    ${response}    GET    ${API_BASE_URL}${path}    params=${parameters}    expected_status=anything
    VAR    &{result}    status=${response.status_code}    body=${response.json()}
{%- else %}
    ${response}    GET    ${API_BASE_URL}${path}    query=${parameters}
    VAR    &{result}    status=${response}[status]    body=${response}[body]
{%- endif %}
    RETURN    ${result}

Send Post Request
    [Documentation]    Sends data as JSON to an endpoint.
    [Arguments]    ${path}    &{data}
{%- if api_library == 'requests' %}
    ${response}    POST    ${API_BASE_URL}${path}    json=${data}    expected_status=anything
    VAR    &{result}    status=${response.status_code}    body=${response.json()}
{%- else %}
    ${response}    POST    ${API_BASE_URL}${path}    body=${data}
    VAR    &{result}    status=${response}[status]    body=${response}[body]
{%- endif %}
    RETURN    ${result}
